    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:small\">I am trying to use the function digit.fixed() to select landmarks, but there is a problem that regardless of which point I select, it registers only a single point over and over. I&#39;m trying to select different points but it seems to be stuck on a single point. I have tried with a mouse and a trackpad and have been careful to follow the instructions. Below is an example of the R console:</div><div style=\"font-size:small\">c &lt;- digit.fixed(gutTube2, fixed=3, index=F, ptsize=5, center=T)<br>Keep Landmark  1 (y/n)?<br>y<br>Select Landmark  2<br>Keep Landmark  2 (y/n)?<br>y<br>Select Landmark  3<br>Keep Landmark  3 (y/n)?<br>y<br>&gt; c<br>      xpts     ypts     zpts<br>1 986.3554 418.4549 37.19143<br>2 986.3554 418.4549 37.19143<br>3 986.3554 418.4549 37.19143<br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\">This problem persists if I use the buildTemplate() function too.</div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Any help really appreciated, thanks</div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Esther</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
